  "paper_id": "eurosys-2026-gopher-efficient-dynamic-graph-pattern-mining-via-dag-dr-7aeff1c8",
  "title": "Gopher: Efficient Dynamic Graph Pattern Mining via DAG-Driven Execution",
  "abstract": "Graph pattern mining is essential for analyzing dynamic networks, where graphs evolve over time. To accommodate these changes, existing solutions update match sets incrementally, avoiding the need to re-mine the entire graph and achieving significant performance improvements. However, these methods suffer from inefficiencies due to redundant set intersection operations across subgraph instances, causing performance degradation.",
